[I] The Galène videoconference server

[T] Galene is a videoconferencing server that is easy to deploy and requires
[T] moderate server resources. It is described at <https://galene.org>.

[U] https://galene.org/

[A] Juliusz Chroboczek <jch@irif.fr>
[M] NoTag <notag@t2sde.org>

[C] extra/network
[F] CROSS

[L] MIT
[V] 1.2

[D] 870acae466e153e4f1ba0bfc572e4deb83e0bc780735e2bf07ff3536 galene-1.2.tar.gz https://github.com/jech/galene/archive/galene-1.2/

